Date: Sat, 4 Jul 2026 19:16:04 +0530
Subject: [PATCH] feat(public): refresh landing page and brand typography

Summary:
- Refresh the public landing page and shared visual system
- Add brand display fonts and landing hero asset
- Cover typography and logo contracts with frontend tests

Test plan:
- python3 -m py_compile src/entry.py src/static_routes.py
- python3 -m pytest tests/test_landing_typography.py tests/test_public_logo.py tests/test_dashboard_landing_migration.py
